'''Flames''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by crafting it. In order to have crafted it, you needed to salvage a [[Seer]], a [[Tides]], and a [[Heat]] to obtain the required materials. Upon the release of [[Season 1]], it became only obtainable through trading as the crafting recipe was removed from the game.

==Appearance==
Flames has a sword-like shape, and the blade of the knife is an orangey yellow mesh that spurts out of the handle. Its handle has an orange square gem prism with two mini flames on the left and right. The handle on the knife is a burnt sienna color with a small gem on the bottom.

==Trivia==
* Flames was the first [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife prior to it being reduced to a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] during [[Season 1]]. It was reduced due to it being a targeted victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2017)|Duping Glitch (2017)]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/241511828/Mystic-Sword-of-the-Flames Mystic Sword of the Flames].
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/585873746/Fire here].
*Players originally needed two godly [[shards]], one [[Fire Orb|fire orb]], one godly [[Metals|metal]], and one [[Water Orb|water orb]] to craft this.

